---
import "../styles/global.css";
import ProfileHologram from "../components/ProfileHologram.jsx";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Szénássy Ákos</title>
  </head>
  <body class="theme-body">
    <div class="dot-grid-overlay"></div>

    <main class="relative z-10 flex flex-col">
      <section class="section-container">
        <div
          class="max-w-[90rem] w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8"
        >
          <div class="glass-panel justify-center">
            <div class="mono-label-red">[ 01_Profile ]</div>
            <h1 class="heading-primary !mb-3">Szénássy Ákos</h1>
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-nothing-red mb-5"
            >
              Cloud &amp; Infrastructure Engineering
            </p>
            <p class="font-sans text-base text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-8">
              Computer Science Engineering student at BME, currently a software
              developer intern at Bosch. I run a hybrid
              <strong class="font-medium text-black">Kubernetes</strong> cluster across
              cloud and edge, with Helm releases behind TLS ingress,
              Prometheus-driven autoscaling, and
              <strong class="font-medium text-black">Keycloak</strong> handling
              authentication for my own applications &mdash; provisioned with
              Terraform, deployed by GitHub Actions.
            </p>
            <div
              class="font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs text-gray-400 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 mt-auto flex justify-between items-center gap-3"
            >
              <span>LOC: Budapest</span>
              <a
                href="https://github.com/akos050607"
                target="_blank"
                class="hover:text-black transition-colors">GITHUB</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>

          <div
            class="bg-gray-100 border border-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden shadow-sm relative"
          >
            <ProfileHologram client:only="react" />
          </div>

          <div class="glass-panel justify-between group">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between relative z-10 mb-8">
              <div class="mono-label !mb-0">[ Status ]</div>
            </div>

            <div
              class="absolute right-[-10%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[250px] md:w-[350px] h-[250px] md:h-[350px] opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none"
            >
              <!-- Wireframe "system core". Pure SVG + CSS: identical read at this
                   size and opacity, but it costs no JavaScript at all. -->
              <svg
                viewBox="0 0 300 300"
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="w-full h-full"
              >
                <g class="core-spin" fill="none" stroke="#000" stroke-opacity="0.15">
                  <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="110"></circle>
                  <ellipse cx="150" cy="150" rx="74" ry="110"></ellipse>
                  <ellipse cx="150" cy="150" rx="36" ry="110"></ellipse>
                  <ellipse cx="150" cy="150" rx="110" ry="74"></ellipse>
                  <ellipse cx="150" cy="150" rx="110" ry="36"></ellipse>
                </g>
                <g
                  class="core-spin-slow"
                  fill="none"
                  stroke="#000"
                  stroke-opacity="0.1"
                  stroke-dasharray="3 7"
                >
                  <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="132"></circle>
                </g>
                <circle class="core-pulse" cx="150" cy="150" r="9" fill="#cc0000"
                ></circle>
              </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="relative z-10 mt-auto">
              <div class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-4 leading-tight">
                Available<br />for Internship
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-6">
                <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-nothing-red animate-pulse">
                </div>
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-500"
                  >Budapest &middot; available now</span
                >
              </div>

              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
                <a
                  href="mailto:szenassy.akos5@gmail.com"
                  class="font-mono text-xs md:text-sm border-b border-black pb-1 hover:text-nothing-red hover:border-nothing-red transition-colors inline-block"
                >
                  [ CONTACT_ME ]
                </a>
                <a
                  href="#role-fit"
                  class="font-mono text-xs md:text-sm text-nothing-red border-b border-nothing-red pb-1 hover:text-black hover:border-black transition-colors inline-block"
                >
                  [ ROLE_FIT ]
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="absolute bottom-4 md:bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-20"
        >
          <div
            class="font-mono text-[10px] md:text-xs text-black font-bold tracking-[0.4em] uppercase mb-2 md:mb-3 animate-pulse drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]"
          >
            Scroll
          </div>
          <div
            class="w-[2px] h-12 md:h-16 bg-gray-600 relative overflow-hidden rounded-full"
          >
            <div
              class="w-full h-1/3 bg-nothing-red absolute top-0 hardware-drop shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(204,0,0,0.8)]"
            >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div id="slide-fade-wrapper" class="relative h-[400vh] w-full bg-black">
        <div class="sticky top-0 h-screen w-full overflow-hidden bg-black">
          <section
            id="section-projects"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center p-6 md:p-12 will-change-transform"
          >
            <div
              class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 opacity-5 font-serif text-[15vw] leading-none pointer-events-none whitespace-nowrap"
            >
              PROJECTS
            </div>

            <div
              class="max-w-[90rem] w-full relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-center h-full py-20"
            >
              <div class="mono-label text-center !text-gray-400">
                [ 02_Projects_Hub ]
              </div>

              <div class="project-grid">
                <div
                  role="button"
                  tabindex="0"
                  data-modal-open="k3s-modal"
                  aria-haspopup="dialog"
                  aria-controls="k3s-modal"
                  class="project-card project-card-large group relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[400px] p-0 border border-gray-800 cursor-pointer"
                >
                  <img
                    src="/images/kubernetes.jpg"
                    alt="Hybrid K3s cluster"
                    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-0 opacity-20 grayscale group-hover:opacity-50 group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
                  />

                  <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/80 to-transparent group-hover:via-black/50 transition-all duration-500"
                  >
                  </div>

                  <div
                    class="relative z-10 p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col h-full justify-end"
                  >
                    <div>
                      <h3
                        class="project-title md:text-3xl text-white group-hover:text-nothing-red transition-colors duration-300 mb-3"
                      >
                        Hybrid Zero-Trust K3s Cluster
                      </h3>
                      <p
                        class="font-sans text-sm md:text-base text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors duration-300"
                      >
                        A cloud node and a physical edge node joined over a
                        Tailscale mesh with zero inbound ports. Helm releases
                        behind TLS ingress, Prometheus-driven autoscaling,
                        Terraform-provisioned VMs, GitHub Actions CI &mdash; and a
                        chaos engineering log of what broke.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                      <span class="stat-chip">K3s + Helm</span>
                      <span class="stat-chip">Prometheus / Grafana</span>
                      <span class="stat-chip">Terraform</span>
                      <span class="stat-chip">Azure</span>
                      <span
                        class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-nothing-red bg-black/60 border border-nothing-red/50 px-2.5 py-1 group-hover:bg-nothing-red group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                        >Read Case Study -></span
                      >
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <a
                  href="https://smartchaincontrol.szenassy-akos.com"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="project-card project-card-wide group relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[190px] p-0 border border-gray-800"
                >
                  <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500 pointer-events-none"
                  >
                    <div class="w-[200%] h-[200%] origin-top-left scale-50">
                      <iframe
                        src="https://smartchaincontrol.szenassy-akos.com"
                        class="w-full h-full border-none"
                        loading="lazy"
                        title="SmartChainControl Live Preview"
                      >
                      </iframe>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/40 to-transparent group-hover:via-black/20 transition-all duration-500"
                  >
                  </div>

                  <div
                    class="relative z-10 p-6 flex flex-col h-full justify-end"
                  >
                    <div
                      class="bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-[2px] p-4 rounded-lg border border-white/5 inline-block max-w-[80%]"
                    >
                      <h3
                        class="project-title text-xl text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-nothing-red transition-colors"
                      >
                        SmartChainControl
                      </h3>
                      <p
                        class="font-sans text-sm text-gray-200 leading-relaxed"
                      >
                        A real-time digital twin simulator I containerised and
                        deployed on my own cluster &mdash; served over TLS through
                        my ingress, and running in production right now.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-4 flex items-center justify-between w-full">
                      <span
                        class="relative bg-black/80 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md border border-gray-700 flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:border-nothing-red transition-colors"
                      >
                        <span
                          class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-nothing-red animate-pulse"
                        ></span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-white font-mono">LIVE</span>
                      </span>

                      <span
                        class="font-mono text-gray-500 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-3 transition-all duration-300 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold"
                      >
                        ->
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </a>

                <div
                  role="button"
                  tabindex="0"
                  data-modal-open="streaming-modal"
                  aria-haspopup="dialog"
                  aria-controls="streaming-modal"
                  class="project-card project-card-wide group relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[190px] p-0 border border-gray-800 cursor-pointer"
                >
                  <!-- Showcase backdrop: a faint network grid washed by a red
                       signal glow — evokes the tunnelled stream, no stock image. -->
                  <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none"
                    style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 82% 18%, rgba(255,51,51,0.35), transparent 55%), linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 100% 100%, 26px 26px, 26px 26px;"
                  >
                  </div>

                  <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:via-black/45 transition-all duration-500"
                  >
                  </div>

                  <div class="relative z-10 p-6 flex flex-col h-full justify-end">
                    <div>
                      <h3
                        class="project-title text-xl text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-nothing-red transition-colors"
                      >
                        NAT Traversal for a Low-Latency Remote Desktop
                      </h3>
                      <p
                        class="font-sans text-sm text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors line-clamp-2"
                      >
                        Getting a self-hosted service out of an enterprise CGNAT
                        firewall that blocks all inbound traffic &mdash; an
                        outbound-only FRP reverse tunnel through a Budapest BIX
                        VPS, cutting 60&nbsp;ms+ to 15&ndash;22&nbsp;ms.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                      <span
                        class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-black/60 border border-gray-700 px-2.5 py-1"
                        >15&ndash;22ms latency</span
                      >
                      <span
                        class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white bg-black/60 border border-gray-700 px-2.5 py-1"
                        >0.00% jitter</span
                      >
                      <span
                        class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-nothing-red bg-black/60 border border-nothing-red/50 px-2.5 py-1 group-hover:bg-nothing-red group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                        >Read Case Study -></span
                      >
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Identity project: OIDC/SAML are the nice-to-haves on the posting
                     that are actually this employer's product. Highest-leverage card. -->
                <div
                  role="button"
                  tabindex="0"
                  data-modal-open="keycloak-modal"
                  aria-haspopup="dialog"
                  aria-controls="keycloak-modal"
                  class="project-card project-card-wide group relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end min-h-[300px] md:min-h-[190px] p-0 border border-gray-800 cursor-pointer"
                >
                  <!-- Identity backdrop: concentric trust rings, no stock image. -->
                  <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-30 group-hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-700 pointer-events-none"
                    style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, rgba(255,51,51,0.3), transparent 50%), repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 20% 80%, transparent 0 22px, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 22px 23px);"
                  >
                  </div>

                  <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-gradient-to-t from-black via-black/70 to-transparent group-hover:via-black/45 transition-all duration-500"
                  >
                  </div>

                  <div class="relative z-10 p-6 flex flex-col h-full justify-end">
                    <div>
                      <h3
                        class="project-title text-xl text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-nothing-red transition-colors"
                      >
                        Keycloak Identity Provider on K3s
                      </h3>
                      <p
                        class="font-sans text-sm text-gray-400 group-hover:text-gray-300 transition-colors line-clamp-2"
                      >
                        Keycloak deployed by Helm behind TLS ingress, protecting a
                        real application with an OpenID Connect authorization code
                        flow &mdash; plus a SAML client built alongside it to compare
                        the two federation protocols end to end.
                      </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                      <span class="stat-chip">OIDC + PKCE</span>
                      <span class="stat-chip">SAML 2.0</span>
                      <span
                        class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-nothing-red bg-black/60 border border-nothing-red/50 px-2.5 py-1 group-hover:bg-nothing-red group-hover:text-white transition-colors"
                        >Read Case Study -></span
                      >
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <a
                  href="https://github.com/akos050607/SpendSmart"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="project-card project-card-normal group"
                >
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="project-title">SpendSmart</h3>
                    <p class="font-sans text-sm text-gray-400 line-clamp-4">
                      Expense pipeline extracting structured data from receipt
                      images via OCR/LLMs into PostgreSQL &mdash; and the
                      application now sitting behind Keycloak as the OIDC-protected
                      resource.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="project-link">GITHUB -></span>
                </a>

                <a
                  href="https://github.com/akos050607/PremiereFlow"
                  target="_blank"
                  class="project-card project-card-normal group"
                >
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="project-title">PremiereFlow</h3>
                    <p class="font-sans text-sm text-gray-400 line-clamp-4">
                      Spring Boot REST API with a React client, using WebSockets
                      for live seat updates and optimistic locking to survive
                      concurrent bookings without double-selling a seat.
                    </p>
                  </div>
                  <span class="project-link">GITHUB -></span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 md:bottom-12 md:right-12 flex flex-col items-center z-50"
            >
              <div
                class="font-mono text-[10px] text-gray-500 tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-3 animate-pulse"
                style="writing-mode: vertical-rl; transform: rotate(180deg);"
              >
                Scroll
              </div>
              <div
                class="w-[1px] h-12 md:h-16 bg-gray-800 relative overflow-hidden mt-1"
              >
                <div
                  class="w-full h-1/3 bg-nothing-red absolute top-0 hardware-drop"
                >
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section
            id="section-tech"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full bg-white flex items-center justify-center p-6 md:p-12 will-change-transform translate-x-full shadow-[-20px_0_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]"
          >
            <!-- Ordering is deliberate: infrastructure first, application code after.
                 For cloud roles the old ordering read as "backend dev with a homelab". -->
            <div
              class="max-w-6xl w-full bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-6 md:p-12 shadow-sm max-h-[85vh] overflow-y-auto"
            >
              <div class="mono-label-red !mb-8 text-center">
                [ 03_Tech_Stack ]
              </div>

              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-7">
                <div class="tech-group">
                  <div class="tech-group-label">Cloud &amp; Containers</div>
                  <div class="tech-badges">
                    <span class="tech-badge">Azure</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Kubernetes / K3s</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Docker</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Helm</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Proxmox VE</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Hetzner Cloud</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-group">
                  <div class="tech-group-label">CI/CD &amp; IaC</div>
                  <div class="tech-badges">
                    <span class="tech-badge">GitHub Actions</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Terraform</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Automated testing</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">kubeconform</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">GHCR</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Git / GitHub</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-group">
                  <div class="tech-group-label">Identity &amp; Security</div>
                  <div class="tech-badges">
                    <span class="tech-badge">Keycloak</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">OAuth 2.0 / OIDC</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">SAML 2.0</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">TLS / cert-manager</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Tailscale zero-trust</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-group">
                  <div class="tech-group-label">Observability</div>
                  <div class="tech-badges">
                    <span class="tech-badge">Prometheus</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Grafana</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">metrics-server / HPA</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">ApacheBench</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-group">
                  <div class="tech-group-label">Networking &amp; Linux</div>
                  <div class="tech-badges">
                    <span class="tech-badge">Ubuntu / Debian</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Bash scripting</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Nginx ingress</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">systemd</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">FRP tunneling</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">DNS / NAT traversal</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tech-group">
                  <div class="tech-group-label">Programming</div>
                  <div class="tech-badges">
                    <span class="tech-badge">Go</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Python</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">Java / Spring Boot</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">C# / .NET</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">TypeScript</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">REST APIs</span>
                    <span class="tech-badge">PostgreSQL / SQL</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Requirement-to-evidence map. A recruiter screening a stack of CVs
           should be able to tick every line on the posting without hunting. -->
      <section
        id="role-fit"
        class="w-full bg-white py-24 md:py-32 px-6 relative z-10 scroll-mt-0"
      >
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="mono-label-red !mb-4">[ 04_Role_Fit ]</div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight mb-4">
            What the role asks for, and what I have built.
          </h2>
          <p
            class="font-sans text-sm md:text-base text-gray-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-14"
          >
            Rows marked with an arrow open the full write-up.
          </p>

          <div class="border-t border-gray-300">
            <div
              role="button"
              tabindex="0"
              data-modal-open="k3s-modal"
              class="fit-row fit-row-clickable"
            >
              <div class="fit-req">Major cloud platform</div>
              <div class="fit-ev">
                Azure &mdash; the cluster workload redeployed onto Azure VMs and
                provisioned with the <code>azurerm</code> Terraform provider.
              </div>
              <div class="fit-arrow">-></div>
            </div>

            <div
              role="button"
              tabindex="0"
              data-modal-open="k3s-modal"
              class="fit-row fit-row-clickable"
            >
              <div class="fit-req">Docker, Kubernetes &amp; Helm</div>
              <div class="fit-ev">
                Services containerised with multi-stage Dockerfiles and
                orchestrated on a two-node hybrid K3s cluster across cloud and
                edge. Helm releases, TLS ingress, HPA autoscaling under real
                load, and a documented chaos engineering log.
              </div>
              <div class="fit-arrow">-></div>
            </div>

            <div class="fit-row">
              <div class="fit-req">CI/CD automation</div>
              <div class="fit-ev">
                GitHub Actions pipelines covering build, test and deploy: unit
                tests and kubeconform manifest validation run before anything
                else, then the container image is built and pushed to GHCR on
                tag. This site rebuilds and deploys itself on every push to
                <code>main</code>.
              </div>
              <div class="fit-arrow-empty"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="fit-row">
              <div class="fit-req">Software quality &amp; security</div>
              <div class="fit-ev">
                Nothing reaches an environment unchecked: automated tests and
                manifest validation gate every pipeline, and at Bosch I work
                inside a pull-request and code-review workflow. On the
                infrastructure side that means TLS everywhere, no inbound ports
                on the edge node, and secrets kept out of the repositories.
              </div>
              <div class="fit-arrow-empty"></div>
            </div>

            <div
              role="button"
              tabindex="0"
              data-modal-open="streaming-modal"
              class="fit-row fit-row-clickable"
            >
              <div class="fit-req">Linux &amp; networking</div>
              <div class="fit-ev">
                Ubuntu and Proxmox VE administration, systemd units, Nginx
                ingress and proxying, DNS and TLS &mdash; including a reverse
                tunnel that gets traffic out of an enterprise CGNAT firewall at
                15&ndash;22 ms.
              </div>
              <div class="fit-arrow">-></div>
            </div>

            <div
              role="button"
              tabindex="0"
              data-modal-open="keycloak-modal"
              class="fit-row fit-row-clickable"
            >
              <div class="fit-req">
                OAuth 2.0 / OIDC / SAML
              </div>
              <div class="fit-ev">
