            >
              The Challenge
            </h3>
            <p class="font-sans text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
              Reaching a self-hosted, virtualised remote desktop environment from
              outside a strict university enterprise firewall (CGNAT), while
              holding end-to-end latency under 25&nbsp;ms. The network blocks all
              inbound connections and applies aggressive UDP timeouts &mdash; the
              same constraint any service behind carrier-grade NAT faces.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h3
              class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-nothing-red mb-3"
